WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Speaker 1: One of the things we've been talking&nbsp;
about for some time is that the Republican Party&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.400
has completely given up on policy. They just&nbsp;
they don't even talk about policy anymore.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.360
Sometimes it sort of sounds like maybe they're&nbsp;
approximating what might be considered policy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:20.320
but it's essentially just cultural issues.&nbsp;
But I have for you today a supposed policy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:26.960
platform. This is from Republican Senator&nbsp;
Rick Scott, who published an 11 point plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:35.840
to quote Rescue America. It's delusional, depraved&nbsp;
and disgusting and dangerous, and we're going to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:41.120
take a look at what is on this plan. And he will&nbsp;
very quickly see that for the most part, this is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:48.080
just cultural nonsense masquerading as policy.&nbsp;
We won't spend a ton of time on each point, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:54.320
I'll give you a sense of what they are. Point one&nbsp;
our kids will say the Pledge of Allegiance Salute&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.320 --> 00:01:02.080
the flag learned that America is a great country&nbsp;
and choose the school that best fits them. That&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:09.520
all together is an attack on funding of public&nbsp;
schools in favor of charter voucher type programs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:17.920
Continued opposition to letting teachers determine&nbsp;
how best to teach their students. And this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:23.600
cultural imposition of salute the flag, say&nbsp;
the Pledge of Allegiance. This is cultural&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:28.240
nonsense masquerading as policy. No to the&nbsp;
government will never again ask American&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:33.120
citizens to disclose their race as race,&nbsp;
ethnicity or skin color on government forms.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:39.520
They want you to think that those questions can&nbsp;
only be racist or can only be for wokeness. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:45.840
the reality is that collecting that information&nbsp;
in so many different ways allows us to see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:56.480
whether there are groups being discriminated&nbsp;
against, not necessarily openly, but in practice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:02.080
and implicitly. And it's really important that we&nbsp;
have that data. We're not looking to use it in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:06.800
way Republicans claim it should be used. But if&nbsp;
you don't collect that data, you quite literally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:16.480
have no idea whether there are real inequalities&nbsp;
along the lines of race, ethnicity and skin color&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.400
that we might want to address. We can't even&nbsp;
have that conversation if you don't collect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:25.760
the data. OK? Number three, The soft on crime days&nbsp;
of cradle at coddling criminal behavior will end.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:32.400
We will refund the police. Remember, the police&nbsp;
hasn't been defunded. And as a national or state&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:36.960
policy, these decisions are basically made at the&nbsp;
municipality level. There are some municipalities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:42.320
who have made changes to bring in social workers,&nbsp;
or we might not replace all the police cars right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:47.680
now or whatever. The police have not been defunded&nbsp;
in any systemic way, and it's simply another one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:54.400
of these cultural issues. OK. Number four.&nbsp;
And these are kind of all over the map for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.520
we will secure our border finish building the wall&nbsp;
and name it after President Donald Trump. The wall&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:04.320
is obviously not getting built. The wall is also&nbsp;
not the solution to our immigration problem. It's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:10.320
a distraction. And naming it after Trump, another&nbsp;
one of these virtue signaling nonsense claims we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:16.800
will grow America's economy, starve Washington's&nbsp;
economy and stop socialism. So this is an argument&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:22.560
number one against nonexistent socialism, another&nbsp;
cultural battle that they are fighting and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:29.040
code for. We will cut social welfare programs.&nbsp;
Number six, we will eliminate all federal programs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:34.880
that can be done locally and enact term limits&nbsp;
for federal bureaucrats in Congress. Term limits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:40.480
I'm actually open to, but again eliminating all&nbsp;
federal programs that can be done locally. A lot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:46.080
of programs can be done locally, but it doesn't&nbsp;
make any sense to me. And that's another way to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:50.880
simply cut welfare. Number seven, we will protect&nbsp;
the integrity of American democracy and stop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:55.840
left wing efforts to rig elections straight up&nbsp;
projection. Trump tried stealing the election,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:02.640
and they are now just projecting that onto the&nbsp;
left. Total nonsense culture war issue number&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:07.200
eight We will protect, defend and promote&nbsp;
the American family at all costs, saying the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:14.080
nuclear family is crucial to civilization that&nbsp;
can have within it any number of homophobic.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:22.400
Transphobic and other disgusting aspects.&nbsp;
Number nine, men are men, women are women and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:29.200
unborn babies are babies, so both transphobic and&nbsp;
anti-abortion. Number 10 Americans will be free to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:35.920
welcome God into all aspects of our lives, very&nbsp;
clearly trying to take down separation of church&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:42.080
and state. Bring prayer back to school, et cetera,&nbsp;
et cetera. And number 11, we are Americans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:48.160
not globalists, which is sort of an allusion to&nbsp;
this America first nationalism type rhetoric.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:53.280
Not a surprise that that's also something&nbsp;
they want to push. This is a plan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.280 --> 00:05:01.200
guys. It's an 11 point plan. Nine and a half&nbsp;
of the 11 points are just a rehashing of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:07.280
same culture war issues that we've seen them&nbsp;
play for a long time. The other one and a half&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:11.600
are just excuses to cut welfare.&nbsp;
That's the plan, guys. That's the plan

